<title>UK: Brent cargo trades higher at Aug +10 cents - trade.</title>
<headline>Brent cargo trades higher at Aug +10 cents - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of July loading Brent crude traded on Wednesday at August Brent +10 cents, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load in the July 21-23 window was sold to a major at a five-cent premium to a deal on Tuesday.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
